{
  "bookId": "hero-211001",
  "id": "bond-29300",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29300001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "早上好啊，莉可。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……切，什么，就只有你一个人啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看来除了我之外，莉可还有其他想要见到的人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "本，本王才没这么说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不……不对！本王什么时候说想要见到你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "开个玩笑。不过莉可一个人，好像很孤独的样子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "才不会孤独！而且这也不叫孤独，这叫做魔王的威严！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "没有人赶来侵犯我的私人空间，不就证明了本王的强大了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "那些弱小的家伙才没有靠近我的资格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我有接近莉可的资格吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你……勉勉强强吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "太好了，那正好让我来陪陪你？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "本王不是说了吗，这不是孤独！本王才不要你需要你陪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……不过你要是寂寞需要本王陪伴的话……哼，倒不是不可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29300015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我就恭敬不如从命了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
